    <string name="about_body">ClassicPod 4.1\n\nA lightweight iPod Classic–style player for this OPPO A33f.\nOffline: play MP3s stored on the phone.\nOnline: internet radio and custom stream URLs when Wi‑Fi or mobile data is available. No ads and no paid APIs.\nSaved stations still appear without a network; they play only when you are online.\n\nMenu, Previous, Next and Play surround the click wheel. Circle the wheel to move the highlight. Press the center to select. Menu goes back.\n\nTo leave ClassicPod as Home: Settings → Change Home App → choose OPPO Launcher (or your previous launcher).</string>
